   "q": "On the exam, 2,3-dibromobutane and two equivalents of base gave three products. Here both bromines are on the <b>same</b> carbon. 2,2-Dibromobutane is treated with two equivalents of a strong base. Which of these {{C4H6}} compounds can <b>not</b> form?\n[[mol:CCC(Br)(Br)C]]",
